              "texto": "The same idea with **y**: [[7277|y becomes e]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "o... o..., o bien",
              "texto": "More on **o**: [[8076|o / u / o bien]]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kwiz",
      "titulo": "Check yourself",
      "bloques": [
